@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
hide empty description
state "待处理" as INIT
state "待处理" as S1
state "处理中" as S2
S1 --> S2 : 运营开始处理 [批次已导出]
state "已完成" as S3
S2 --> S3 : 核实好友已收到 [完成依据已填写]
state "处理异常" as S4
S2 --> S4 : 链接错误/无法赠送 [异常原因已记录]
S1 --> S1 : 超过累计 2 小时 [未完成]
S4 --> S2 : 客服协商后可继续 [有处理方案]
@enduml